	(text_box "SPEC:  \nU1  AS5047P-ATSM  ams  TSSOP-14\n14-bit (16384 counts/rev) | up to 28 krpm | DAEC\nSPI slave, mode 1 (CPOL=0, CPHA=1), up to 10 MHz, MSB first\n"
